              "position": 1,
              "name": "Set up the course",
              "text": "Deal 35 cards face up into seven columns of five; the remaining 17 form the stock, with one card turned up as the starting waste."
          },
          {
              "@type": "HowToStep",
              "position": 2,
              "name": "Know the goal",
              "text": "Clear all the tableau columns by moving their cards onto the waste pile."
          },
